  - type: 0
    text: "This is your final trial, Pactkeeper. The Corrupt Tactician cowers on the far eastern edge at (3, 0) with 4 HP."
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: "Unite every discipline you have forged - Half-Instant displacement, high-ground Ambush, Trinket reach, and Momentum - to fell him in a single Instant!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Druid at (0, 0) to open the combo.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 15
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click Pull! to rip the Tactician out of his sanctuary.
    tutorialTargetId: CSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Target the Corrupt Tactician at (3, 0) to drag him onto (1, 0)!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 3, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm Pull!
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 3
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: "He is snared at (1, 0)! Select your Assassin - now leading the Ready Bar from (0, -1)."
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Vault in an L-step onto the high ground at (1, 1), directly above the Tactician!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 1, y: 1}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm your Assassin's bound.
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 2.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Assassin at (1, 1) to prime a Critical Ambush.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click Dagger Thrust.
    tutorialTargetId: WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Strike downward onto (1, 0) for 2 Ambush damage!
